            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>John von Neumann's Early Life</strong><br>\nJohn von Neumann was born in Budapest, Hungary, in 1903. He was recognized early on for his exceptional intelligence. By the age of six, he could divide two eight-digit numbers in his head. He excelled at languages as well, speaking Ancient Greek and Latin fluently by the time he was a teenager. His brilliance in mathematics became evident at a young age, leading him to pursue a career in mathematics and science.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Academic Grounding</strong><br>\nVon Neumann received his Ph.D. in mathematics with minors in experimental physics and chemistry at the age of 22 from the University of Budapest. He then went on to study at the University of Göttingen, which was then the mecca of mathematical physics. His professors included David Hilbert and Hermann Weyl, under whose guidance von Neumann made significant contributions to set theory, quantum mechanics, and operator theory.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Contributions to Mathematics</strong><br>\nJohn von Neumann contributed to several fields of mathematics, including set theory, functional analysis, quantum mechanics, ergodic theory, continuous geometry, economics, and statistics. He provided a mathematical foundation for quantum mechanics with his work on operator theory. He also developed the concept of the von Neumann algebra and the pointwise ergodic theorem, demonstrating his breadth of knowledge across mathematical disciplines.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
